n","    try await Task.sleep(for: .milliseconds(300))","    await send(.results(try await api.search(query)))","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Distinct ids are independent; two effects tagged with the same id are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cancelled together. The tag is dropped automatically when the effect","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"finishes. Top-level scopes register synchronously at dispatch; scopes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"invoked inside another effect become active only at invocation, and run as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a child task, so cancelling one cancels that scope rather than the effect","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hosting it. Use ","type":"text"},{"code":"Effect.map","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to preserve metadata when lifting actions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Outside a store-run effect (for example a direct call in a unit","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"test) there is no context to register with, and the effect simply runs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once cancelled, the effect’s sends are dropped — including one from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"catch"},{"type":"text","text":" block — so a stale result can’t be published. To clear an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in-flight flag when the effect is cancelled, pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onCancel:"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux"]]},"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/SwiduxReducer":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"SwiduxReducer","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SwiduxReducer"}],"navigator